# The screen build reads the Cargo workspace files and the manifests and
# sources of the `idle` and `display` crates. An allowlist keeps the Go
# sources, the docs, and the deploy manifests out of this build context,
# so a change to them does not rebuild the screen images. The `idle`
# tests run in CI and no image stage reads them.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!idle/Cargo.toml
!idle/src/
!display/Cargo.toml
!display/src/
